OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral assault dad admits further
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a teenager who died in a
OL,7,Fhead-on crash, which also killed two
OL,8,Fpolice officers, has pleaded guilty to
OL,9,Fpossession of Class C drugs and theft.
OL,11,FGye Worthy, 40, previously admitted
OL,12,Fcommon assault against a celebrant at
OL,13,FTeesside Crematorium in Middlesbrough
OL,14,Fduring the funeral of his son Cole, one
OL,15,Fof the seven who died when a car hit a
OL,16,Fmarked police car on the A66 in South
OL,17,FBank on 22 August.
OL,19,FHe also previously admitted resisting
OL,20,Farrest at the funeral and stealing four
OL,21,Fbottles of wine from a shop.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
