OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral assault dad admits further
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Teesside Magistrates' Court he
OL,7,Fadmitted possessing the drugs and three
OL,8,Fcounts of stealing. He is due to be
OL,9,Fsentenced on 17 December.
